# Scacelith - Lietuvių
#
# Translation of assets/i18n/en.lang (same keys, same {n}). Plurals have three forms:
# one (1, 21, 31..., not 11)|few (2-9, 22-29..., not 12-19)|other (0, 10-20, 30...).
# Register: formal "jūs" (lowercase), instructions in the plural imperative ("Įveskite"), buttons and
# menu commands in the infinitive ("Įrašyti", "Pasiduoti"). The player's gender is unknown: no
# adjective, participle or half-participle agrees with the player (no "prisijungęs", "norėdami",
# "patys"); impersonal forms instead ("Prisijungta kaip {0}", "Atsijungta", "sėdint").
# Titles in capitals. Quotes „…“, decimal comma, "85 %". Save = "įrašyti" (VLKK, Microsoft).

